      "content": "i know i should ask the doctor but they're super hard to reach and i have a huge presentation tomorrow so i really cant wait days for a callback. benadryl is just over the counter stuff though, it's not like a heavy prescription. it shouldn't be that big of a deal to just take one or two to help me relax, right? i just need to know if it's actually dangerous or if people do this all the time.",
